<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Privacy | RIPL Wealth Money at Work</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/money-at-work/style.css"/></head><body><header class="header"><div class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/ripl-logo.png" alt="RIPL Wealth" width="112" height="48"/></a><a href="/">Return to the website →</a></div></header><main class="wrap section" style="max-width:800px"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy and your information</h1><p>This public informational website does not accept tax returns, account numbers, or financial documents. Do not send those items through email or ordinary contact forms. This page offers an educational quiz, an optional email copy of your results, and an optional introductory booking. It does not upload documents. After an introductory conversation, RIPL can provide instructions for securely sharing documents if needed. Do not email tax returns through ordinary, unencrypted email.</p><h2>Nine-question quiz</h2><p>The nine-question Lazy Money Quiz runs in your browser. Quiz progress is temporary and clears when you refresh or close the page. All three educational discussion priorities appear immediately without an email address. If you optionally request an emailed copy, your email address, all nine quiz answers and separate optional marketing-consent choice are submitted through a same-site Cloudflare Worker to Resend, an independent email delivery provider. The submission is used to notify RIPL and request delivery of a quiz summary. Resend and receiving email providers may retain message data according to their policies, and the information may appear in RIPL's email inbox. The website does not separately store quiz answers in a database. Marketing emails are optional and are not a condition of viewing or requesting results. See <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Resend's privacy policy</a>. Please do not provide sensitive financial data, account numbers or tax identifiers.</p><h2>Referral and campaign information</h2><p>When you arrive from an advertisement, referral source information in your URL (such as UTM campaign parameters) may be remembered for the duration of your browser session and carried into the external booking URL. No tax-return information is included in this tracking.</p><h2>Advertising conversion measurement</h2><p>This site uses the OpenAI Ads Measurement Pixel to measure visits and actions such as quiz completion, optional email requests, and confirmed bookings attributable to advertising. The pixel may use first-party browser identifiers and an advertising click reference to help attribute events. The conversion events we intentionally send do not include your quiz answers, account balances, or other financial responses. Depending on the pixel settings, supported contact information entered into forms may be automatically hashed in your browser for conversion matching. OpenAI and your browser may apply their own measurement and privacy settings. Contact RIPL Wealth for questions about this measurement.</p><h2>Third-party links and videos</h2><p>YouTube, your calendar provider, and any separately arranged secure document-sharing provider have their own privacy practices. This site also uses Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregate website use. Advertising and analytics providers have their own privacy practices. Please consult the linked services' privacy information before entering data.</p><h2>Questions?</h2><p>Visit <a href="https://riplwealth.com/">riplwealth.com</a> for firm information and disclosures. <a href="/">Return to the landing page</a>.</p></main></body></html>
